            "review_title": "Review at Mango Cafe Xoai Xoai",
            "review_text": "Jessica C\nGreensboro, North Carolina8 contributions\n0\nThe Sweetest Place!\nSep 2015\nSuper cute atmosphere and concept! We walked in 5 minutes before closing (20:00) and they still gave us a warm welcome. The mango beer was interesting. The best part was the beer making the mango pieces fizzy. I really enjoyed the mango snowflake. I really wish I could've tried all of their mango goodies!\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 10, 2015",
